      "name": "Witchy Precure!! ~MIRAI DAYS~",
      "overview": "After being miraculously reunited a few years later, Mirai and the others begin to take steps towards their futures in their respective worlds. Mirai is a college student in the Magicless World. Liko, who returned to the Magic World, is a teacher at the Magic School. Mofurun, as always, is at Mirai's side. Ha-chan exists far away, watching over the world.\n\nHowever, a new disaster threatening the Magic and Magicless worlds has appeared...\n\nDue to signs of the coming disaster, Mirai and Liko reunite for the first time in months.\n\nWhile attempting to resist this mysterious enemy, they both come face to face with not only their past, but their future.\n\nWith the magical words \"Cure Up RaPaPa!\", their exciting tale is once again set into motion!",
